        scheme: ["V_low = −GM/6.77×10⁶ = −5.88×10⁷ J kg⁻¹", "V_high = −GM/4.22×10⁷ = −9.43×10⁶ J kg⁻¹", "ΔV = V_high − V_low = +4.93×10⁷ J kg⁻¹; the higher orbit is at higher (less negative) potential"],
