        scheme: ["Magnetic force F = BQv is always perpendicular to v, so it acts as a centripetal force: BQv = mv²/r", "r = mv/(BQ) = (9.11×10⁻³¹ × 2.0×10⁶)/(0.050 × 1.60×10⁻¹⁹)", "= 2.3×10⁻⁴ m", "Gravity on the electron is ~mg = 9×10⁻³⁰ N, utterly negligible against BQv = 1.6×10⁻¹⁴ N"],
